     SOURCE ID: vernacular-ephemera-calendar-pinup-pad
     CREATIVE SPARK: the top half is a painting somebody was paid real money for, the bottom half is twelve months of thin paper, and across the middle in gold script is the name of a hardware store that closed in 1968.
